From the above reaction,

\mathrm{K}_c=\frac{\left[\mathrm{CO}_2\right]}{\left[\mathrm{CH}_4\right]\left[\mathrm{O}_2\right]^2}

\mathrm{K}_p=\frac{\mathrm{P}_{\mathrm{CO}_2}}{\mathrm{P}_{\mathrm{CH}_4} \times \mathrm{P}_{\mathrm{O}_2^2}}

So, $\quad \mathrm{K}_p=\frac{\left[\mathrm{CO}_2\right]}{\left[\mathrm{CH}_4\right]\left[\mathrm{O}_2\right]^2}$ is incorrect.

